<Layout title="Website privacy — Vertabyte" description="How Vertabyte Tech Limited handles email enquiries and information associated with this corporate website. No analytics or non-essential cookies.">
  <div class="document-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">VERTABYTE TECH LIMITED</p><h1>Website privacy</h1><p>This notice covers the Vertabyte corporate website at vertabyte.tech. It does not describe the data practices of our software products.</p></div></div>
  <article class="container document">
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 19 September 2026</p>
    <h2>Who to contact</h2><p>Vertabyte Tech Limited is responsible for this corporate website. For questions about this notice or your personal information, email <a href="mailto:info@vertabyte.tech?subject=Privacy%20enquiry">info@vertabyte.tech</a>.</p>
    <h2>When you email us</h2><p>If you contact us by email, we receive your email address, any name you provide, the content of your message and any attachments you send. We use this information to respond to your enquiry, provide the assistance you request and manage related correspondence.</p><p>Please include only the information needed for your enquiry. Do not send passwords, payment card details or sensitive information about other people.</p>
    <h2>Website and hosting information</h2><p>This is a static information website. It has no account registration, contact form or database. Our hosting provider may process basic request information, such as an IP address, requested page, browser information, time of access and error information, to deliver and secure the website. The details and retention of any hosting logs depend on the hosting service and its configuration.</p>
    <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2><p>This website does not use analytics, advertising trackers or non-essential cookies. Our website code does not set cookies or store information in your browser. Fonts and site assets are served with the website; we do not embed third-party media or social widgets.</p>
    <h2>Service providers and retention</h2><p>Email and hosting services process information as needed to deliver those services. We do not sell personal information received through website enquiries. We retain correspondence only for as long as needed to handle the enquiry, maintain relevant business records and meet applicable obligations. No fixed retention period for hosting logs is stated here because it depends on the hosting configuration.</p>
    <h2>Questions and requests</h2><p>You can contact <a href="mailto:info@vertabyte.tech?subject=Privacy%20request">info@vertabyte.tech</a> to ask about information you have sent us or request its correction or deletion. We will consider requests in line with applicable requirements and may need to confirm your identity before acting.</p>
    <h2>Products and future changes</h2><p>Software products may have separate privacy notices reflecting how those products operate. This notice applies only to the corporate website. If this website’s practices change, we will update this page and its revision date.</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
